# No em dashes

Never use the em dash character (`—`, U+2014) in this app.

Applies to:
- Website and UI copy
- Emails and user-facing messages
- README and in-app docs
- Comments and log/error strings in this repo

Use a period, comma, colon, parentheses, or a regular hyphen (`-`) instead.

```text
❌ brand name — preview before you publish
✅ brand name. Preview before you publish

❌ n/a shown as —
✅ n/a shown as -
```
